5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I am the Seer. I will use my ability wisely to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"Wow, a Seer! That’s great news. I’m just a regular villager, so I’ll follow your lead.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""May"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**May**: Wow, a Seer! That’s great news. I’m just a regular villager, so I’ll follow your lead.""}]}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I’m so excited! I’m just a little villager, but I’ll help however I can. Who should we watch closely?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let’s stay calm and observe. Asuka, your divination is key. We’ll trust the process and avoid jumping to conclusions.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"I’ll observe. Asuka, your word is law. May, your eagerness is noted.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,I won't reveal my results yet. Let's hear more from everyone before I make my first call.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"I’m just a villager, so I don’t have any special info. Let’s keep the conversation open and see who else has something to say.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,I think we should all share our thoughts! Who feels the most suspicious so far? I’m ready to help!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,I agree with Asuka. Premature accusations are dangerous. Let’s wait for the night results before making any moves.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,I agree with Minako. Patience is key. Let’s wait for the night results before making any moves.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"I appreciate the patience. May, your quick claim of villager status is interesting. Let’s see if your actions match your words.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,"I’m just being honest! I have no secrets. Let’s focus on finding the real threat, not accusing each other.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I think May is right! We should be nice to each other. I’m just a little girl, so I don’t know much, but I trust everyone!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Rin, your naivety is concerning. We need to be vigilant, not trusting blindly. Asuka, please share your findings.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Minako"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Minako: Rin, your naivety is concerning. We need to be vigilant, not trusting blindly. Asuka, please share your findings.""}]}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"I find Rin’s blind trust amusing. Asuka, silence is suspicious. May, your defense is too perfect.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will reveal my findings tomorrow. For now, I trust the process. Let’s end this day and see who survives the night.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,May,,Fair enough. I’ll wait for your results. Let’s hope the night is peaceful for everyone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! I hope everyone stays safe. I’ll be here cheering for us!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Minako,,Agreed. Rest well. We will reconvene tomorrow with the necessary information to make a sound decision.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Minako"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Minako: Agreed. Rest well. We will reconvene tomorrow with the necessary information to make a sound decision.""}]}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,Goodnight.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
