31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have my result. May is the werewolf.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,May,,"That’s a bold claim. I’m a villager, Asuka. Why would you target me?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"May is the werewolf? I don’t believe it! I trust May, she’s so nice. Asuka, are you sure?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Asuka, your word carries weight. May, your denial is expected. Let’s hear Shion’s take before we decide.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Asuka’s claim is strong. May, your denial is weak. I vote for May.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"May, your denial is weak. I stand by my divination.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,May,,"I’m being framed! Asuka, you’re lying to protect yourself. I’m a villager, and I have nothing to hide.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I don't know what to do! May is my friend! Asuka, please don't hurt her!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Asuka, I trust your divination. May, your emotional outburst is suspicious. I vote for May.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I stand by my vote. May, your panic is your only evidence.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"May, your accusations are baseless. I have the truth. The village must act now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,May,,"I refuse to accept this witch hunt! Asuka, you’re the real threat. I’m innocent, and I demand a fair vote!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,I’m so confused! Why is everyone fighting? I just want us to be friends. Please don’t hurt May!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Rin, your emotional plea is noted, but facts matter. May, your deflection fails. I stand by my vote for May.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Rin, your defense of May is illogical. The evidence points to her. I will not be swayed by sentiment.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
